fn st_put b edit uchar 9264 off ulong v ulong n ulong to void
for i ulong n
put b add off i uchar and shr v mul i 8 255
end
end
fn st_get b edit uchar 9264 off ulong n ulong to ulong
v = ulong 0
s = ulong 0
for i ulong n
v = or v shl ulong get b add off i s
s = add s 8
end
ret v
end
fn st_zero b edit uchar 9264 n ulong to void
